2) Module.Close / Store.Close: small reclaim only (metadata / some scratch).
3) Engine.Close: may drop EngineInner Arc, but VmRSS often still far above baseline → NOT mainly Go leak.
4) no_engine arm: if RSS similar to full arm after Module+Store Close, unreclaimed pages are not waiting on Engine.Close.
5) Extra threads after compile often persist (rayon trampoline pool / runtime), independent of Module/Store Close.
